# SABOTAGE: the scheduled reversal no longer MIRRORS the accrual — it repeats it.
#
# WS-ACCT Phase 5 (ADR-054 D6) makes the automatic reversal one action with the
# accrual: `:post_accrual` lands the posted accrual AND a linked DRAFT reversal
# dated in the next period. The reversal is the exact flip (Dr ↔ Cr) of every
# line plus its dimension_refs, which is what makes the pair net to zero across
# the period boundary. This patch removes ONLY the swap in `mirror_line/1` —
# `debit_cents` reads the DEBIT, `credit_cents` reads the CREDIT, the line's
# account, memo and dimensions are copied unchanged.
#
# That is the plausible regression, not a strawman: `debit_cents:
# fetch(line, :debit_cents)` is what anyone writing "a copy of the line" touches
# first, and the result still LOOKS right. The reversal is internally balanced,
# so R1 (`PostBalance`) passes; it carries a cost object, so R6
# (`DimensionBalance`) sees nothing odd; it is dated in the right period, so
# `PeriodGuard` admits it and the soft-close allowlist is untouched. Every
# structural check is green while the books are wrong: February's "reversal"
# charges the expense a second time instead of releasing it, the liability
# never clears, and the trial balance closes at 2× instead of zero.
#
# Why the flip is attributable: the two red-path tests that catch it are the
# ones that quantify the NET-OUT (the mirrored-line assertion and the
# per-account/organisation balance returning to zero), not the ones that assert
# a row exists or a date is honoured. Those stay green under this patch — the
# reversal is still created, still linked, still draft, still dated — which is
# exactly what says the flip landed on the accounting semantics rather than on
# the plumbing.
#
# APP: samen_core
# TEST_FILES: test/finance_accruals_test.exs
# MUST_FAIL: the accrual posts and a DRAFT reversal is linked, mirrored and dated
# MUST_FAIL: January carries the expense, February the flip, and the books close at zero
--- a/samen_core/lib/samen/scopes/finance/accrual_guard.ex
+++ b/samen_core/lib/samen/scopes/finance/accrual_guard.ex
@@ -139,10 +139,10 @@
 
   # debit ↔ credit, dimensions copied verbatim (see the moduledoc).
   defp mirror_line(line) do
     %{
       account_id: fetch(line, :account_id),
-      debit_cents: fetch(line, :credit_cents) || 0,
-      credit_cents: fetch(line, :debit_cents) || 0,
+      debit_cents: fetch(line, :debit_cents) || 0,
+      credit_cents: fetch(line, :credit_cents) || 0,
       memo: fetch(line, :memo),
       dimension_refs: fetch(line, :dimension_refs) || %{}
     }
